# Bot-training data artifacts (scraped games + generated datasets) - large,
# regenerable from the scripts, and not needed at runtime. Only
# netlify_functions/topeRetrievalIndex.json (the trimmed runtime index) is
# actually deployed; everything here is offline data-prep tooling output.
scripts/bot-training/raw-games/
scripts/bot-training/*.jsonl
scripts/bot-training/retrieval/*.jsonl